1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,069
Jiwoo's agreement allows two revisions.

2
00:00:02,069 --> 00:00:07,862
Her client wants a second outfit, one more face edit, and maybe merch use.

3
00:00:07,862 --> 00:00:11,586
The AI checks the agreement and prices the extras.

4
00:00:11,586 --> 00:00:14,483
Eighty plus twenty is one hundred dollars.

5
00:00:14,483 --> 00:00:18,621
Merch is only a question, so it is not billed.

6
00:00:18,621 --> 00:00:19,862
Both sides approve.

7
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:24,000
This is a PayPal sandbox, so no real money moves.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,483
Here is how the agreement began.

9
00:00:27,983 --> 00:00:30,052
Jiwoo pastes the client's chat.

10
00:00:30,052 --> 00:00:34,603
The AI lists each term with the exact words behind it.

11
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:38,328
Revisions are flagged, because the client only said maybe.

12
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:40,810
Usage rights and email are unknown.

13
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:44,121
It drafts a reply with a Korean translation.

14
00:00:48,121 --> 00:00:50,603
She fills the gaps and accepts.

15
00:00:50,603 --> 00:00:53,086
The client accepts on their phone.

16
00:00:53,086 --> 00:00:55,983
Now both sides share the same terms.

17
00:01:00,983 --> 00:01:03,052
Back to the change order.

18
00:01:03,052 --> 00:01:06,362
Both approved, so the agreement became version two.

19
00:01:06,362 --> 00:01:12,569
Rules, not the AI, build the invoice from her rate card, one line per extra.

20
00:01:12,569 --> 00:01:16,293
Jiwoo approves, and the backend creates it in PayPal.

21
00:01:16,293 --> 00:01:18,362
A second approval sends it.

22
00:01:24,362 --> 00:01:28,086
This is the client's view on PayPal's own page.

23
00:01:28,086 --> 00:01:30,155
The extra outfit, eighty dollars.

24
00:01:30,155 --> 00:01:32,224
The extra revision, twenty dollars.

25
00:01:32,224 --> 00:01:35,121
One hundred in total, and no merch.

26
00:01:35,121 --> 00:01:38,017
The agreed terms travel inside the invoice.

27
00:01:42,017 --> 00:01:44,914
The sandbox buyer pays this same invoice.

28
00:01:44,914 --> 00:01:49,052
The invoice number and amount match the one Jiwoo sent.

29
00:01:58,052 --> 00:02:01,776
Back in the app, PayPal reports the invoice paid.

30
00:02:01,776 --> 00:02:05,500
Only then does the app settle the change order.

31
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,983
The status is read from PayPal.

32
00:02:11,983 --> 00:02:17,362
It is for illustrators and character artists who take commissions from clients abroad.

33
00:02:17,362 --> 00:02:22,328
Real here: Gemini reading the chat, and PayPal sandbox invoicing and payment.

34
00:02:22,328 --> 00:02:24,810
Sandbox: the money and the buyer.

35
00:02:24,810 --> 00:02:26,466
Messages are pasted in.

36
00:02:26,466 --> 00:02:31,845
The AI fully passed fifteen of twenty test cases, so Jiwoo reviews everything.

37
00:02:31,845 --> 00:02:35,155
The voice and sample art are AI generated.
